  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following represents the correct order of $\\mathrm{Cl}-\\mathrm{O}$ bond lengths in\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{ClO}^{-}, \\mathrm{ClO}_{2}^{-}, \\mathrm{ClO}_{3}^{-}, \\mathrm{ClO}_{4}^{-} \\text {? }$",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "zo511",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{ClO}_{4}^{-}=\\mathrm{ClO}_{3}^{-}=\\mathrm{ClO}_{2}^{-}=\\mathrm{ClO}^{-}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DaevJ",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{ClO}^{-} < \\mathrm{ClO}_{2}^{-} < \\mathrm{ClO}_{3}^{-} < \\mathrm{ClO}_{4}^{-}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0rFSi",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{ClO}_{4}^{-} < \\mathrm{ClO}_{3}^{-} < \\mathrm{ClO}_{2}^{-} < \\mathrm{ClO}^{-}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "o56GL",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{ClO}_{3}^{-} < \\mathrm{ClO}_{4}^{-} < \\mathrm{ClO}_{2}^{-} < \\mathrm{ClO}^{-}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The b.o in $\\mathrm{Cl}-\\mathrm{O}^{-}$is 1\r\n\r\nThe b.o in $\\mathrm{O}=\\mathrm{Cl}-\\mathrm{O}^{-}$is $1.5$\r\n\r\nThe b.o. in $\\mathrm{O}=\\mathrm{Cl}=\\mathrm{O}$ is $\\frac{5}{3}=1.66$\r\n\r\nThe b.o. in $\\mathrm{O}=\\underset{\\mathrm{O}}{\\stackrel{\\mathrm{O}}{\\|}} \\mathrm{l}-\\mathrm{O}^{-}$is $\\frac{7}{4}=1.75$\r\n\r\nThe bond length increases as b.o. decreases.",
